<div dir=3D"auto">Hi, Allison.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I'm writing to inform you that I was unexpectedly dismiss=
ed from my volunteer position at Honeyman State Park today, one week before=
 my scheduled departure. I was not given any paperwork or official document=
ation. I was simply told to turn over
 my keys and leave within 24 hours.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I believe this dismissal was not only unprofessional but =
retaliatory, stemming from a series of escalating tensions initiated after =
I submitted a respectful email expressing concern over a prior interaction =
with leadership. Since that moment,
 I=92ve experienced a breakdown in communication, exclusion, and intimidati=
on. Today=92s action felt targeted and final, without process or fairness.<=
/div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Because I had already committed to this volunteer program=
 for the full year=97with parks lined up nearly every month=97this sudden d=
ismissal has placed me in a logistical and financial crisis. I have no curr=
ent housing and limited funds until I
 begin my next assignment.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">To help provide a fuller picture, I=92ve recorded a video=
 explaining the sequence of events and the emotional and practical weight t=
his situation has placed on me. I=92ve also included my documentation.</div=
>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">You can view the video here:</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><a rel=3D"noreferrer noopener" href=3D"https://youtu.be/B=
1oe-qvjmMI">https://youtu.be/B1oe-qvjmMI</a><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">I am reaching out not only to request review of how this =
was handled but to ask whether there is any immediate support the departmen=
t can offer as I transition. I believe I=92ve served with integrity and dee=
p commitment to the mission of Oregon
 State Parks, and I only ask that I be treated with the same respect.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Thank you for your time and attention. I am available to =
speak further if necessary.</div>
<div dir=3D"auto"><br>
</div>
<div dir=3D"auto">Warm regards,</div>
